    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/533dbaa17b2d78a6a9918c2a04559a3a.avif?t=1753995407\" data-has-big width=800 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fast-paced 2D runner</strong>, offering short yet punishing levels with a focus on <strong>replayability</strong> and <strong>challenge-based progression</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to pick up, tough to master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat levels with skill to unlock tougher stages, secret challenges, and ultimate tests of precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fearless goose \u2013 </strong>Jump, crouch, and strike with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/b5a4ac645c7f8378fc327c2aecec1cac.poster.avif?t=1753995407\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/b5a4ac645c7f8378fc327c2aecec1cac.webm?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/b5a4ac645c7f8378fc327c2aecec1cac.mp4?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Every Level</strong> \u2013 Earn top grades to unlock score attack challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/8576d6104bcd23a42fd72f6726b10dd7.poster.avif?t=1753995407\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/8576d6104bcd23a42fd72f6726b10dd7.webm?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/8576d6104bcd23a42fd72f6726b10dd7.mp4?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feast on Berries</strong> \u2013 Collect them to uncover secret levels.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/749fc72eaf5f550410fc177e332797da.poster.avif?t=1753995407\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/749fc72eaf5f550410fc177e332797da.webm?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/749fc72eaf5f550410fc177e332797da.mp4?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Visuals</strong> \u2013 Colorful, hand-drawn worlds full of charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/9b0c035da8f8b4d7b2d09ff1b780a7c8.poster.avif?t=1753995407\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/9b0c035da8f8b4d7b2d09ff1b780a7c8.webm?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/9b0c035da8f8b4d7b2d09ff1b780a7c8.mp4?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egg Hunt with unexpected twists</strong> \u2013 Reclaim your stolen eggs\u2014and maybe find a few surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/26d31ac4a18760b4ddb055ee500a370a.poster.avif?t=1753995407\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/26d31ac4a18760b4ddb055ee500a370a.webm?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/26d31ac4a18760b4ddb055ee500a370a.mp4?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get New Allies</strong> \u2013 Help other birds find their eggs and unlock them as playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/3b9d493b530c67553459f72490fe8660.poster.avif?t=1753995407\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/3b9d493b530c67553459f72490fe8660.webm?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/3b9d493b530c67553459f72490fe8660.mp4?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/533dbaa17b2d78a6a9918c2a04559a3a.avif?t=1753995407\" data-has-big width=800 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fast-paced 2D runner</strong>, offering short yet punishing levels with a focus on <strong>replayability</strong> and <strong>challenge-based progression</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to pick up, tough to master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat levels with skill to unlock tougher stages, secret challenges, and ultimate tests of precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fearless goose \u2013 </strong>Jump, crouch, and strike with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/b5a4ac645c7f8378fc327c2aecec1cac.poster.avif?t=1753995407\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/b5a4ac645c7f8378fc327c2aecec1cac.webm?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/b5a4ac645c7f8378fc327c2aecec1cac.mp4?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Every Level</strong> \u2013 Earn top grades to unlock score attack challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/8576d6104bcd23a42fd72f6726b10dd7.poster.avif?t=1753995407\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/8576d6104bcd23a42fd72f6726b10dd7.webm?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/8576d6104bcd23a42fd72f6726b10dd7.mp4?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feast on Berries</strong> \u2013 Collect them to uncover secret levels.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/749fc72eaf5f550410fc177e332797da.poster.avif?t=1753995407\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/749fc72eaf5f550410fc177e332797da.webm?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/749fc72eaf5f550410fc177e332797da.mp4?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Visuals</strong> \u2013 Colorful, hand-drawn worlds full of charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/9b0c035da8f8b4d7b2d09ff1b780a7c8.poster.avif?t=1753995407\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/9b0c035da8f8b4d7b2d09ff1b780a7c8.webm?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/9b0c035da8f8b4d7b2d09ff1b780a7c8.mp4?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egg Hunt with unexpected twists</strong> \u2013 Reclaim your stolen eggs\u2014and maybe find a few surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/26d31ac4a18760b4ddb055ee500a370a.poster.avif?t=1753995407\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/26d31ac4a18760b4ddb055ee500a370a.webm?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/26d31ac4a18760b4ddb055ee500a370a.mp4?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get New Allies</strong> \u2013 Help other birds find their eggs and unlock them as playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/3b9d493b530c67553459f72490fe8660.poster.avif?t=1753995407\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/3b9d493b530c67553459f72490fe8660.webm?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381470/extras/3b9d493b530c67553459f72490fe8660.mp4?t=1753995407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
